## 🔗 Mapping: UI Form Fields → Database

### Ví dụ: AddProductDialog (Thêm sản phẩm)

| UI Field (FXML fx:id) | Controller Variable | Java Model | Database Table | Database Column |
|----------------------|---------------------|------------|----------------|-----------------|
| `txtProductName` | `txtProductName.getText()` | `Item.name` | `items` | `name` |
| `txtProductDetails` | `txtProductDetails.getText()` | `Item.description` | `items` | `description` |
| `txtStartingPrice` | `txtStartingPrice.getText()` | `AuctionSession.startingPrice` | `auction_sessions` | `starting_price` |
| `dpStartDate` + `cbStartHour` | `combineDateTime(...)` | `AuctionSession.startTime` | `auction_sessions` | `start_time` |
| `dpEndDate` + `cbEndHour` | `combineDateTime(...)` | `AuctionSession.endTime` | `auction_sessions` | `end_time` |
| `cbCategory` | `cbCategory.getValue()` | `Item` subclass | `electronics` / `arts` / `vehicles` | (subclass table) |

### Luồng dữ liệu:

```
UI Input (FXML)
    ↓
Controller (Java)
    ↓ txtProductName.getText()
Java Model (Item, AuctionSession)
    ↓ protocol.createAuctionOrError(session)
Network (Socket)
    ↓
Server (AuctionService)
    ↓ itemDAO.saveItem(item)
Database (MySQL)
    ↓ INSERT INTO items (name, description, seller_id)
```

