## 📝 Hướng dẫn Data Binding cho từng màn hình

### 1. **BidderDashboard** — Hiển thị danh sách phiên đấu giá

**File**: `BidderDashboardController.java`

**Bước 1**: Load data từ backend
```java
@FXML
private VBox containerAuctions; // Container chứa ProductCard

private ClientProtocolHandler protocol = new ClientProtocolHandler();

@Override
public void initialize(URL location, ResourceBundle resources) {
    loadActiveAuctions();
}

private void loadActiveAuctions() {
    List<AuctionSession> auctions = protocol.getActiveAuctions();
    
    for (AuctionSession session : auctions) {
        try {
            // Load ProductCard.fxml
            FXMLLoader loader = new FXMLLoader(
                getClass().getResource("/fxml/Card/ProductCard.fxml")
            );
            Node card = loader.load();
            
            // Get controller và set data
            ProductCardController controller = loader.getController();
            controller.setAuctionSession(session);
            
            // Add vào container
            containerAuctions.getChildren().add(card);
            
        } catch (IOException e) {
            e.printStackTrace();
        }
    }
}
```

**Bước 2**: Update ProductCardController
```java
public class ProductCardController {
    @FXML private Label lblItemName;
    @FXML private Label lblCurrentPrice;
    @FXML private Label lblTimeRemaining;
    @FXML private Label lblBidsCount;
    @FXML private Button btnPlaceBid;
    
    private AuctionSession session;
    
    public void setAuctionSession(AuctionSession session) {
        this.session = session;
        
        // Bind data
        lblItemName.setText(session.getItem().getName());
        lblCurrentPrice.setText(String.format("$%.2f", session.getCurrentPrice()));
        lblBidsCount.setText(session.getBids().size() + " bids");
        
        // Calculate time remaining
        updateTimeRemaining();
    }
    
    private void updateTimeRemaining() {
        LocalDateTime now = LocalDateTime.now();
        LocalDateTime end = session.getEndTime();
        
        long seconds = ChronoUnit.SECONDS.between(now, end);
        if (seconds < 0) {
            lblTimeRemaining.setText("Đã kết thúc");
        } else {
            long hours = seconds / 3600;
            long mins = (seconds % 3600) / 60;
            lblTimeRemaining.setText(String.format("%dh %dm", hours, mins));
        }
    }
    
