### 2. **SellerDashboard** — Hiển thị sản phẩm của seller

**File**: `SellerDashboardController.java`

```java
private void loadSellerItems() {
    User currentUser = SessionContext.getCurrentUser();
    if (!(currentUser instanceof Seller)) {
        return;
    }
    
    int sellerId = currentUser.getId();
    
    // Load all auctions, filter by seller
    List<AuctionSession> allAuctions = protocol.getActiveAuctions();
    List<AuctionSession> myAuctions = allAuctions.stream()
        .filter(s -> s.getSeller().getId() == sellerId)
        .collect(Collectors.toList());
    
    // Display in cards
    for (AuctionSession session : myAuctions) {
        // Same as BidderDashboard, but add Edit/Delete buttons
        ProductCardController controller = loader.getController();
        controller.setAuctionSession(session);
        controller.showSellerActions(true); // Show edit/delete
    }
}
```

