## 🗂️ Database Field Mapping Reference

### Table: `items`
| Java Field | Database Column | Type | Notes |
|------------|----------------|------|-------|
| `Item.id` | `id` | INT | Auto-generated by backend |
| `Item.name` | `name` | VARCHAR(255) | From `txtProductName` |
| `Item.description` | `description` | TEXT | From `txtProductDetails` |
| `Item.seller.id` | `seller_id` | INT | From `SessionContext.getCurrentUser()` |

### Table: `auction_sessions`
| Java Field | Database Column | Type | Notes |
|------------|----------------|------|-------|
| `AuctionSession.id` | `id` | INT | Auto-generated |
| `AuctionSession.item.id` | `item_id` | INT | Foreign key |
| `AuctionSession.seller.id` | `seller_id` | INT | Foreign key |
| `AuctionSession.winner.id` | `winner_id` | INT | NULL until auction ends |
| `AuctionSession.startingPrice` | `starting_price` | DOUBLE | From `txtStartingPrice` |
| `AuctionSession.currentPrice` | `current_price` | DOUBLE | Updated by bids |
| `AuctionSession.startTime` | `start_time` | DATETIME | From `dpStartDate` + time |
| `AuctionSession.endTime` | `end_time` | DATETIME | From `dpEndDate` + time |

### Table: `bids`
| Java Field | Database Column | Type | Notes |
|------------|----------------|------|-------|
